n, which enters into force today, has long been expected.
>>=20
>> The whole lexicon of Lojban is recreated by direct borrowing from root l=
anguages. If a word in the source language has the form that Lojban morphol=
ofy allows for then the word is borrowed as it is pronounced without any ma=
gical tricks.
>>=20
